= Act one: The silent mill

#scene(title: "The mill", location: "Ödmården, the old mill", present: "Miller Elsa")[
#read-aloud[
The wheel has stopped. The water stands black and still in the race, and something pale moves just beneath the surface before it is gone.
]

The mill has been silent since midsummer. Miller Elsa still lives in the house by the race and keeps the doors *barred* after dusk. Anyone asking about her husband gets the same _short_ answer.

